{"cv":[{"lang":"협업","names":["Gabriel Furman"]}],"lines":[{"t":"Appointed as Assistant","x":"Right... Let me know if you need anything.","u":null,"p":"HOME_PLACE"},{"t":"Talk 1","x":"Watch out. There are a lot of dangerous materials in the workroom.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 2","x":"Engineering Department... Not bad. The head of the department, though... A bit too talkative.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 3","x":"I like machines. They don't talk, but they're always honest with their readings.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 1","x":"Chaos is only an enemy if you're unable to adapt.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 2","x":"When the approaching chaos endangers your loved ones, the thing to do isn't to protect them. It's... to keep them as far away from you as possible.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","x":"No, my comms equipment's fine. Nothing to worry.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"40"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","x":"You want me to say something? Uh, that's the hardest part.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"100"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","x":"My hometown? There... the sky is blue, and all the buildings under it are blue, too.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"200"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Idle","x":"Good... I'll find something to do.","u":null,"p":"HOME_WAIT"},{"t":"Onboard","x":"Rainbow Operator, codename Fuze. I've said everything I need to. Let's get to it.","u":null,"p":"GACHA"},{"t":"Watching Battle Record","x":"No problem. I'll find some time to watch them.","u":null,"p":"LEVEL_UP"},{"t":"Promotion 1","x":"Good. Thank you.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"EVOLVE_ONE"},{"t":"Promotion 2","x":"Do I need to give some crowd a speech? No? Good.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"EVOLVE_TWO"},{"t":"Added to Squad","x":"At your command.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD"},{"t":"Appointed as Squad Leader","x":"Do exactly as I say.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD_FIRST"},{"t":"Depart","x":"Enough talk. Now we act.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_START"},{"t":"Begin Operation","x":"Матрёшка готов поручить.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_FACE_ENEMY"},{"t":"Selecting Operator 1","x":"Focus on the task at hand.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SELECT"},{"t":"Selecting Operator 2","x":"Remember our objectives.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SELECT"},{"t":"Deployment 1","x":"Lower your voice.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_PLACE"},{"t":"Deployment 2","x":"Remain silent.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_PLACE"},{"t":"In Battle 1","x":"With me!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_1"},{"t":"In Battle 2","x":"Remain alert.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_2"},{"t":"In Battle 3","x":"Stay focused.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_3"},{"t":"In Battle 4","x":"Hold position.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_4"},{"t":"4-star Result","x":"Every action builds our chances to win.","u":null,"p":"FOUR_STAR"},{"t":"3-star Result","x":"Asset secured.","u":null,"p":"THREE_STAR"},{"t":"Sub 3-star Result","x":"On your feet, your wounds are not fatal.","u":null,"p":"TWO_STAR"},{"t":"Operation Failure","x":"Move, right now!","u":null,"p":"LOSE"},{"t":"Assigned to Facility","x":"This place isn't bad.","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_PLACE"},{"t":"Tap","x":"Don't do that...","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_TOUCHING"},{"t":"Trust Tap","x":"I made some pilaf. Want some?","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_FAVOR_BUBBLE"},{"t":"Title","x":"Arknights.","u":null,"p":"LOADING_PANEL"},{"t":"Greeting","x":"Hey...","u":null,"p":"GREETING"}]}